<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Lord, have Your expression;</l><l>Do not let me win today.</l><l>Duplicate Your heart in my heart,</l><l>Your life saturates and permeates.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Your love is the burning fire;</l><l>Things of my self You burn away.</l><l>Do gain in me what You desire—</l><l>A loving Bride to match You in every way.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord I open up for You to make</l><l>Your home in my heart li’l more today;</l><l>Make me a part of Your move</l><l>to build up Your church and bring the coming age.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
